      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. the purplish tint thing is helpful. i'll keep an eye out for that. one more thing—i've noticed some weird, small holes and uneven patches in the turf too, almost like something has been nibbling at the roots or digging around in the soil. any idea if that's related to the nutrients or if i'm looking at a pest problem?",
